      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: This seems to be related to the VRChat client loading a cached version of the world from the live client when loading the world on the open beta client.\nReproduction steps:\n1. Clear cache\n2. Load world on live client\n3. Load world on open beta client\nOpen beta client will load the world from the cached version downloaded on the live client, rather than the updated unity 2019 version. \nClearing the cache and loading into the world on the open beta client again loads the correct version. \nI can reproduce it with one of my worlds wrld_fff5d510-fc53-4e88-9d4e-1e0e45a17aff, changelog in the menu will reflect the version that's loaded. Do note that this world is still on .28f1 and not on 29f1 yet.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
