  "details": "I have uploaded my avatar and world in Unity 2019.4.29f1 and it loads those versions in game directly after uploading, but I wanted to look at it again today and the game loaded the old 2018.4.20f1 avatar and world. \nIt seems like it switches back to loading the old versions instead of the new ones after some time.\nOutput Log: https://pastebin.com/QUUhUWkN",
